WEBVTT

00:01:28.334 --> 00:01:32.213
what happened next
is that populations boomed,

00:01:32.255 --> 00:01:35.925
villages turned into towns,
towns became cities,

00:01:35.967 --> 00:01:37.969
and with the emergence of cities,

00:01:38.010 --> 00:01:43.474
our species was locked on a familiar
trajectory of development

00:01:43.474 --> 00:01:48.563
where spiraling populations
and technological change

00:01:48.563 --> 00:01:53.109
were bound up with the kind
of dreadful inequalities

00:01:53.151 --> 00:01:55.778
that we see around us today.

00:01:57.738 --> 00:02:00.658
Except, as anyone can tell you,